{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02918","headline":"太母魏氏半径题石 · 陈元光","name":"太母魏氏半径题石","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乔岳标仙蹟，玄扃妥寿姬。\n乌号非岭海，鹤仰向京师。\n系牒公侯裔，悬弧将相儿。\n清贞蜚简籍，规范肃门楣。\n万里提兵路，三年报母慈。\n劒埋龙守壤，石卧虎司碑。\n忧阕情犹结，祥回禫届期。\n竹符忠介凛，桐杖孝思凄。\n许史峋嶙篆，曹侯感旧诗。\n鸿蒙山暝啓，骏彩德昭垂。\n华表瑶池冥，清漳玉树枝。\n昭题盟岳渎，展墓庆重熙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈元光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02918.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02918","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}